# Joveo Dashboard Layout Rules

## Page Structure
- Every dashboard page must have a consistent layout with:
  - Fixed left sidebar (72px width)
  - Fixed top header (64px height)
  - Main content area with proper padding (32px)
  - White background for content sections
  - Light gray background (#F4F5FB) for page background

## Section Separation
- All major sections must be separated by:
  - 24px gap between sections
  - White background for each section
  - Border: 1px solid #E2E6F1
  - Border radius: 8px
  - Internal padding: 24px

## Grid System
- Use 4-column grid for metric cards
- Grid gap: 24px
- Full width sections for charts and tables
- Maintain consistent spacing between elements

## Charts
- All charts must have:
  - White background container
  - Border: 1px solid #E2E6F1
  - Border radius: 8px
  - Internal padding: 24px
  - Proper axis labels and grid lines
  - Consistent color scheme from design tokens

## Tables
- Tables must have:
  - Full width layout
  - Fixed header with white background
  - Border bottom on header and rows
  - Consistent cell padding
  - Hover states on rows
  - Status indicators with proper colors

## Responsive Behavior
- Maintain fixed sidebar width
- Allow content area to be scrollable
- Keep metric cards in grid layout
- Stack sections vertically on smaller screens